080311F0 message-open-script-return

The final a keyword test at 0803133A leaves zero in r0 when the
keyword is absent. When present, Script_GetValue replaces r0 and
fastPlayback is written using r1 and r2.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

